.Dd October 29, 2026
.Dt XANATOO 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm xanatoo
.Nd interactive document composition engine
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Ar options
.Op Ar file Op Ar file2
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
edits Markdown, Org and Gemtext documents live and browses web pages,
feeds, Wikipedia, Gemini, Hacker News, Reddit, Lemmy and Nostr as
read-only documents.
.Pp
One
.Ar file
(or URL) opens that document; two open side by side.
With none,
.Pa examples/welcome.md
from the data directory opens.
HTML opens as a read-only reader view; EPUB, DOCX, ODT, reStructuredText,
LaTeX and other formats are imported to Markdown through
.Xr pandoc 1
without changing the original.
.Pp
Press F1 in the program for the keyboard reference.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl h , Fl \-help
Print a usage summary and exit.
.It Fl v , Fl \-version
Print the version and exit.
.It Fl f , Fl \-fullscreen
Start fullscreen.
.It Fl w , Fl \-windowed
Start in a window.
.It Fl g , Fl \-geometry Ar W Ns x Ns Ar H
Window size in pixels; the default is 1024x768.
.It Fl o , Fl \-open Ar path
Open
.Ar path ,
the same as giving it as an argument.
.It Fl \-font Ar path
TrueType or OpenType font for body text.
.It Fl \-ui-scale Ar n
Scale of the menus, toolbar and default text size.
.It Fl \-data-dir Ar dir
Installed data: example documents, help, style sheets, toolbar icons.
.It Fl \-config-dir Ar dir
Settings.
.It Fl \-state-dir Ar dir
Drafts of unsaved edits, revisions, folds, bookmarks and history.
.It Fl \-user-data-dir Ar dir
Your own style sheets, in
.Pa styles/ .
.It Fl \-cache-dir Ar dir
Thumbnails, downloads and imported documents.
.It Fl \-portable
Keep all of the above in
.Pa userdata/
next to the executable.
Also enabled by a file
.Pa portable.txt
next to the executable.
.It Fl \-no-save
Write no settings and no state during this run.
Unsaved edits then have no drafts, so closing an edited document asks
first.
.It Fl \-show-paths
Print every directory and where it came from, then exit.
.It Fl \-
End of options; the following arguments are paths.
.El
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Ev XDG_CONFIG_HOME , XDG_STATE_HOME , XDG_DATA_HOME , XDG_CACHE_HOME
Base directories for settings, state, user data and cache.
Used only when set to an absolute path.
.It Ev XANATOO_FONT
Body font when
.Fl \-font
is not given.
.It Ev XANATOO_REDDIT_CLIENT_ID , XANATOO_REDDIT_CLIENT_SECRET
Reddit OAuth credentials, used when anonymous access is refused.
.It Ev XANATOO_REDDIT_USER_AGENT , XANATOO_LEMMY_USER_AGENT
User-Agent override for the Reddit and Lemmy clients.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Pa $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/xanatoo/view.conf
Preferences.
.It Pa $XDG_STATE_HOME/xanatoo/
Revision store with drafts of unsaved edits, folds, bookmarks and
history.
.It Pa $XDG_DATA_HOME/xanatoo/styles/
User style sheets.
.It Pa $XDG_CACHE_HOME/xanatoo/
Thumbnails, downloads and imports.
.It Pa <prefix>/share/xanatoo/
Installed data.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr pandoc 1
